 "name_en": "Actual Costing (33Q)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Actual Costing (33Q)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiofcb68bfd26944a5ab013e7b3370c14e9\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofcb68bfd26944a5ab013e7b3370c14e9__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This solution process enables actual costing for material inventory. Initially, all goods movements in a period are valuated based on standard price. All price and exchange rate differences for the material are collected in the material ledger. Similarly, all confirmations are valuated based on a standard activity rate. At the end of the period, an actual price (called the periodic unit price) is calculated for each material based on actual costs within the period, and an actual activity rate is calculated based on the actual costs for the cost center. This calculated actual price can then be used to revalue inventory, COGS and WIP at period end. For actual costing, to calculate the periodic unit price for your materials, you need to activate actual costing in addition to the material ledger. You also need to choose single-level or multilevel price determination for your materials and use price control standard price for all materials you want to use in actual costing.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofcb68bfd26944a5ab013e7b3370c14e9__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Execute actual price calculation</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create a costing run</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Analyze total material price related to movement and current stock</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor material quantity</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofcb68bfd26944a5ab013e7b3370c14e9__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Revalue COGS, WIP, and ending material inventory at period end based on actual costing</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>实际成本核算 (33Q)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiofcb68bfd26944a5ab013e7b3370c14e9\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofcb68bfd26944a5ab013e7b3370c14e9__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">该解决方案流程启用物料库存的实际成本核算。最初，基于标准价格评估期间中的所有货物移动。物料的所有价格和汇率差异都收集在物料分类账中。同样，所有确认均基于标准活动率进行评估。在期末，根据期间内的实际成本计算每个物料的实际价格（称为定期单价），并根据成本中心的实际成本计算实际活动费率。然后，此计算的实际价格可用于在期末重估库存、销货成本和在制品。对于实际成本核算，要计算物料的定期单价，除物料分类账外，还需要激活实际成本核算。您还需要为物料选择单级或多级价格确定，并为要在实际成本核算中使用的所有物料使用价格控制标准价格。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofcb68bfd26944a5ab013e7b3370c14e9__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">执行实际价格计算</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建成本核算运行</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">分析与移动和当前库存相关的总物料价格。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">监控物料数量</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiofcb68bfd26944a5ab013e7b3370c14e9__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">基于实际成本核算，在期末重估 COGS、WIP 和期末物料库存</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
